WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.241
[BEEPING]

00:00:04.359 --> 00:00:06.150
MARK MIRCHANDANI:
Welcome the first episode

00:00:06.150 --> 00:00:09.530
on the Baseline Data,
ML, and AI quest.

00:00:09.530 --> 00:00:11.670
This quest of all
introductory-level, self-paced

00:00:11.670 --> 00:00:13.710
labs is intended for
the complete beginner

00:00:13.710 --> 00:00:14.876
in Google Cloud.

00:00:14.876 --> 00:00:16.500
You'll get your
first-touch experiences

00:00:16.500 --> 00:00:18.630
with a subset of the
Google Cloud Services

00:00:18.630 --> 00:00:21.810
that provide tools for working
with big and small data,

00:00:21.810 --> 00:00:24.840
machine learning, and artificial
intelligence services in Google

00:00:24.840 --> 00:00:25.349
Cloud.

00:00:25.349 --> 00:00:27.390
After you're done with
all the labs in the quest,

00:00:27.390 --> 00:00:29.705
you'll get this badge to
recognize your achievement.

00:00:29.705 --> 00:00:31.830
You can add the badge to
your social media accounts

00:00:31.830 --> 00:00:34.230
and resume to let others
know about your new skills.

00:00:34.230 --> 00:00:36.477
The way the show works is
you'll watch a short video,

00:00:36.477 --> 00:00:38.310
like this one, where
I'll be introducing you

00:00:38.310 --> 00:00:40.860
to a lab on Qwiklabs and give
you a quick overview of what

00:00:40.860 --> 00:00:41.859
you'll learn.

00:00:41.859 --> 00:00:43.650
I'll also point you to
additional resources

00:00:43.650 --> 00:00:46.097
where you can find more
information about each topic.

00:00:46.097 --> 00:00:47.680
Once you're done
watching the episode,

00:00:47.680 --> 00:00:49.830
you can head on over to
Qwiklabs and do the lab.

00:00:49.830 --> 00:00:52.230
You can watch all the videos
and then do all the labs,

00:00:52.230 --> 00:00:54.870
or you can work on the labs
and then pop over to the videos

00:00:54.870 --> 00:00:56.372
to find additional resources.

00:00:56.372 --> 00:00:58.080
This is your quest,
and you can follow it

00:00:58.080 --> 00:00:59.517
in the best way that suits you.

00:00:59.517 --> 00:01:01.350
You don't even need to
do the labs in order.

00:01:01.350 --> 00:01:02.850
I'm excited to get
started, so let's

00:01:02.850 --> 00:01:04.650
move on to our next
episode and first lab

00:01:04.650 --> 00:01:06.270
in the quest, BigQuery--

00:01:06.270 --> 00:01:09.066
Qwik Start Using the
Web User Interface.

